@finland_parliament
title: Finnish Parliament (1917)
is-card: true
card-image: img/reichstag_2.jpg
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
// Temporary compatibility mapping: preserve the original game's parliamentary
// seat-share variables until its elections, events, and party UI are ported.
// spd = SDP; z = Agrarian League; ddp = Young Finnish Party;
// dvp = People's Party; dnvp = Finnish Party; other = Swedish People's Party.
// The German KPD and NSDAP slots have no Finnish 1917 counterpart.
// Seat variables are percentages of the chamber, NOT numbers of seats.
if (Q.finland_1917_initialized !== 1) {
    Q.spd_r = 46;
    Q.kpd_r = 0;
    Q.z_r = 13;
    Q.ddp_r = 12;
    Q.dvp_r = 2.5;
    Q.dnvp_r = 16;
    Q.nsdap_r = 0;
    Q.other_r = 10.5;
    Q.old_spd_r = Q.spd_r;
    Q.old_kpd_r = Q.kpd_r;
    Q.old_z_r = Q.z_r;
    Q.old_ddp_r = Q.ddp_r;
    Q.old_dvp_r = Q.dvp_r;
    Q.old_dnvp_r = Q.dnvp_r;
    Q.old_nsdap_r = Q.nsdap_r;
    Q.old_other_r = Q.other_r;
    Q.finland_1917_initialized = 1;
}
Q.finland_parliament_seen = 1;
!}

= Finnish Parliament - October 1917 election

The Parliament of Finland has 200 seats. A majority requires 101 seats.

Social Democratic Party (SDP) — 92 seats.

Agrarian League (Maalaisliitto) — 26 seats.

Young Finnish Party (Nuorsuomalainen puolue) — 24 seats.

People's Party (Kansanpuolue) — 5 seats.

Finnish Party (Suomalainen puolue) — 32 seats.

Swedish People's Party (RKP) — 21 seats.

These are the October 1917 starting seats. They are now also stored in the original game's parliamentary state. Its party-support model, future elections, and German events still need to be adapted for Finland.

- @main: Return to main screen

